    comment "en" """
        Source V2120 = Swedish extension of ICD-10 V21.2 (motorcycle rider, unspecified, injured in
        nontraffic collision with pedal cycle) further specified by activity=sport/exercise. Source
        clinical meaning = victim role in nontraffic motorcycle accident; the activity axis
        (sport/work/etc.) is a Swedish-added context dimension. Targets: SNOMED CT 437738 (concept_code
        214640008); SNOMED CT 438310 (concept_code 10298002). These are the crosswalk targets of the parent
        V21.2 (Athena concept_id 45599878 Maps to 437738 and 438310). Targets are broader than source:
        they capture the accident/victim-role but not the activity subdetail. Moderate confidence:
        mechanical crosswalk via parent V21.2, not independently re-verified for the Swedish extension;
        breadth mismatch on activity axis.
        """
}
